WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Confirm the store identity
Confirm the tenant identity or store code before reviewing records.
Branches belong to their store; they are not separate vendor workspaces.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check participation and workspace
A vendor organization and an approved tenant-vendor link are different
records. Confirm the active workspace before interpreting products,
commission or orders.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Inspect the product and variant
Match the name, SKU, brand and state before opening a product. A saved
parent product is separate from a purchasable, active and priced
variant.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Separate staff roles and accounts
Read each staff member’s role and active/blocked state. Staff
permissions govern dashboard actions; customer groups do not grant these
permissions.

